stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending
  Pending --> Completed : update status
  Pending --> Cancelled : POST /:id/cancel<br/>no payments, no returns
  Completed --> Cancelled : POST /:id/cancel<br/>no payments, no returns
  Cancelled --> Pending : POST /:id/uncancel<br/>statusBeforeCancel = Pending
  Cancelled --> Completed : POST /:id/uncancel<br/>statusBeforeCancel = Completed
  Pending --> Deleted : DELETE /:id (soft)<br/>stock re-credited
  Completed --> Deleted : DELETE /:id (soft)<br/>stock re-credited
  Deleted --> Pending : POST /:id/restore<br/>availability re-check
  Deleted --> Completed : POST /:id/restore
  note right of Deleted
    deletedAt stamped.
    Payments/returns block delete
    and cancel.
  end note
